window.products.push({"id":593054,"name":"Getek 12 Pcs Premium Silicone Lids / Food Covers, 6 Size Reusable Durable and Expandable Silicone Stretch Lid, Heat Resistant Containers Jars, Oven, M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BGvf-9ywL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Here's a new twist on the old food storage container tops you have in your cupboard!  This Stretchable Silicone Covers Set is the new level of food storage to have a smarter home with no spills, oxidation or diffused odors. The adjustable set of stretching lids is suitable for any kitchenware, containers, or fruit and greens of all sizes and shapes. 6 different diameter sizes -- 8.3 inch/ 21.0 cm diameter -- 6.5 inch/ 16.5 cm diameter  -- 5.7 inch/ 14.5 cm diameter  -- 4.5 inch/ 11.5 cm diameter -- 3.7 inch/ 9.50 cm diameter  -- 2.6 inch/ 6.50 cm diameter Tips for Use: -- Start with the edge closest to you, get the edge on the side of bowl and gently spread around the outer edges until you get to the other side.and don't dip the water over the lid when using it, which will cause the lid to slip -- Pro Tip: Once the lid is on, use one of the tabs to pick up the edge and push the lid into the bowl to create a vaccum seal. Package Includes: -- 2 x 6 Different diameter sizes silicone stretch lids Note: -- Cover with container when entering microwave oven, never put it in seal -- away from knives and forks and other sharp, easy to cut silicone cover articles -- When in use, keep container and product dry and prevent slipping. -- Please allow 1-3 cm due to manual measurement (0.4-1.2 inches) errors  -- After each use, clean lids with soap and hot water or put in the dishwasher. Avoid abrasive or force-foam cleaners -- for the first time, please wash it with water first. The new silicone gel itself produces a non irritating taste, which is normal and can be lost over a period of time or after boiling. -- if you use silicone products for the first time, the phenomenon of adhesion appears to be caused by the stickiness of the new product. It is a normal condition. Please separate the sealing and sticking parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BGvf-9ywL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Getek","source_asin":"B07177BJ4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07177BJ4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07177BJ4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
