window.products.push({"id":593169,"name":"Waechtersbach Christmas Tree 3-Piece Beverage Service","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413D5YJ5W0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Christmas Tree pattern from Waechtersbach has been a holiday tradition since 1976. The combination of holiday red, Christmas tree green and snowflake white decorations are an intregal theme during the holiday season. With this 3pc beverage service everyone is guarunteed to have a cup of holiday cheer. Set includes one tea/coffee pot, one creamer, and one sugar. All pieces are highfired ceramic earthenware and are dishwasher safe. Over the years dozens of shapes and pieces have been introduced including dinnerware, glassware, linens, and accessories. New pieces are added to the assortment every year so collectors new and old have something to look forward to. Amazon.com Bold and bright, Waechtersbach's Christmas Tree collection was created in 1976. With a somewhat retro feel, the pattern retains contemporary elements, while harkening back to an earlier decade. A fire engine red glaze adds a festive quality to each item, while also ensuring that the collection does not go unnoticed. Forest green christmas trees decorated with snow-white candles, stars, and snowflake garlands break up the solid red background, adding a good dose of holiday cheer. The 3-piece Christmas Tree beverage service includes a 72-ounce tea/coffee pot, 6-ounce creamer, and 8-ounce sugar bowl with lid. Standing 7-1/4 inches high, the tea/coffee pot features a large handle, wide mouth, and rounded finial atop the lid. The sugar bowl and creamer mimic the design of the tea/coffee pot on a smaller level. Made in Germany from high fired ceramic eathenware, each tableware piece can safely be placed in the dishwasher. --Lea Werbel What's in the Box Beverage service. Set includes: 72-ounce tea/coffee pot; 6-ounce creamer; 8-ounce sugar bowl. 3 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413D5YJ5W0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waechtersbach","source_asin":"B00020XXTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00020XXTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00020XXTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":593170,"name":"DECORKEY Large Candle Lantern Decorative, 17.3\" Outdoor Lantern with LED Candle, Indoor Outdoor Farmhouse Candle Holder for Porch Table Decor, Valenti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WoWBIDYPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VINTAGE SQUARE CANDLE LANTERN - DECORKEY large square farmhouse lanterns are hand painted with a distinguished, rustic metal finish effect. Black metal features a distressed brushed look. Retro design will add classic beauty and create an elegant look which is perfect to use year after year, even with the ever-changing trends. Just add a tealight candle or flameless LED and this piece radiates light through textured glass for a calming glow and enjoy a peaceful day. 【Special Timer Function】 This lantern with a LED candle is 3 AAA batteries (NOT INCLUDED) powered with timer mode which saves you the hassle of manually turning on and off the flameless candle. It will turn your battery candle off automatically after 6H of use, and power back on 18H later. 【Great Choice As Gift】 - With no glass, this lantern is perfect for displaying your favorite scented, unscented, or LED candle. Customize your decor for a look that reflects your unique personal style. Perfect as Valentine's Day gift, ST.Patrick's Day gift, Easter gift, mother’s day gift, wedding gift, birthday gift, anniversaries gift. Everyone will love this special home decor. 【 Indoor & Outdoor Decorations】 Add this lantern to your porch steps, mantels, and windows for a festival touch. Brighten up your pathways and entryways this holiday season with our Christmas candle lanterns. And ideal for seasonal decor whether for your decorating for your dinner party, bedroom, outdoor patio or kitchen. Ideal for yard, pathway, driveway, shelf, table, bar, photo booths, patio, porch, etc. 【Sturdy Build】 This decorative lantern is made from supreme quality wrought iron material with rust-resistant powder coating which is durable but lightweight for long-time use. The LED candle was checked carefully before shipping. Turn on the LED candle inside the lantern to illuminate your space in a soft and dreamy glow. Measures 7.3\" L x 6.3''W x 17.3\" H(with ring). 【100% Customer Satisfaction】We provide 100% satisfaction after-sale service if there is anything wrong with your order, or the goods you received are damaged. Please don't worry. Just feel free to contact us, and we will make every effort to solve your problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WoWBIDYPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECORKEY","source_asin":"B0B9BW7J3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BW7J3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BW7J3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
