window.products.push({"id":593200,"name":"Eparé Bundle: 5oz Set of 2 Champagne Flute Glasses & 9oz Set of 2 Whiskey Glasses - Stemless Sparkling Wine Glasses & Double Wall Bourbon Rock Glasswa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814aCisR-kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful hand-blown champagne flutes will delight you and your guests with their upscale contemporary double-wall design. It appears as if the liquid inside is suspended in air! So why settle for ordinary glassware? But they not only look great. They are made of high-quality chemistry-grade hand-blown borosilicate glass so they are scratch and shatter-resistant and can stand up to everyday use. This also allows them to be made thinner and more elegant while being capable of withstanding thermal shock. The double-wall design provides insulation, so the liquid inside stays cold while resisting condensation on the outside of the glass. Expect nothing less from Eparé. These modern and elegant double-walled whiskey glasses offer both utility and aesthetic pleasure. The double-wall construction insulates the glass so you can enjoy your favorite liquor, juice, or soda undiluted by melted ice longer - while drinking in the pleasing optical illusion of the liquids floating in air in your cup. Hold them in your hand and it won't feel cold, they will stay room temperature to the touch. And there is little to no condensation on the exterior of the glasses, so you won't have to worry about mess or damage to tabletops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814aCisR-kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eparé","source_asin":"B08LVXK23X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LVXK23X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LVXK23X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
