window.products.push({"id":593247,"name":"5 Pairs Fiberglass Reusable Chopsticks Dishwasher Safe, Slivek Premium Non-slip Japanese Chinese Korean Chopsticks, Family Chop Sticks Gift Set, 9.56 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XwXGJp7ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Grade Fiberglass Material Slivek chopsticks are made of reusable glass fiber, which is superior to other materials such as bamboo, wood, metal or plastic. High temperature resistance, corrosion resistance, excellent hardness and toughness, wear resistance and durability, and good insulation. Widely used for kitchen utensils. BPA-free，lead-free，NO paint, NO lacquer, NO wax, NO metallic taste, NO burrs. Unique Non-slip Design The angular chopsticks prevent the chopsticks from slipping off the fingertips or rolling on the table, easy to hold and very beginner-friendly. The tip of the chopsticks has a non-slip matte texture to prevent food from falling between the chopsticks and avoid embarrassing moments when eating. Specifications Material: Fiberglass Size: 9.56inches Color: White and Gold Exquisite Gift Packaging This chopsticks set is packed in a luxurious and exquisite gift box, which can be directly used as birthday, wedding, housewarming, new year gifts, etc. First Time Using Soak it in warm water for 10-15 minutes before using it for the first time, wash it with detergent, air dry or wipe it off with a rag, then you can use it with confidence. Warm Tips 1. Please do not use steel wool to clean, it will cause the chopsticks to be scratched. 2. The disinfection time should not exceed 10 minutes. If the time is too long, the chopsticks will be aged and deformed. Customer Service If you are not satisfied with the chopsticks for any reason or have any questions about the quality of the chopsticks, you can contact us for a replacement or a full refund, we will provide you with sincere service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XwXGJp7ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slivek","source_asin":"B0BNQGFB65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQGFB65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQGFB65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
