window.products.push({"id":593434,"name":"Copper Chef Oven Crisper Tray for Bacon & More | Baking Sheet & Air Crisper Pan | Use Hot Air to Crisp & Fry Bacon Without Oil or Fat | Non Stick & Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DF376AKAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HEALTHIER AND MORE DELICIOUS BACON - Skip the fat, oil, sprays, and cook your bacon more healthily and quickly with the Copper Chef Oven Crisper Tray.  - This oven bacon pan with rack features Copper-Tech nonstick coating that lets you cook without added fat and oil. Enjoy healthy, crispy, and crunchy bacon every time you cook with this oven pan with a rack. - The oven bacon rack and pan are oven-safe up to 450°F. NONSTICK CRISP WAVE RACK - Cook your bacon evenly on any side with this nonstick crisp wave rack. The design of the crisper tray uses Air-Crisp Technology that allows heated air to pass through and circulate full 360° of your bacon. - The copper crisper tray can cook 12 strips of bacon at once. It also works on all cuts of bacon like super-thin slices or extra-thick cuts. - Baking bacon has never been this so easy with the bacon rack for oven cooking. It transforms your oven into an air fryer. DRIP PAN FOR CATCHING GREASE - The drip pan acts as a catcher for all grease, crumbs, and splatters that go through from the crisper tray. - The drip pan measures 13\" x 11\" and can even use as a baking sheet for your baking needs. Everything's better with bacon, and now you can make your bacon even better. The Copper Chef Crisper Tray for Bacon is an alternative way to cook bacon more healthily and quickly with less mess. The bacon oven pan with rack comes in Copper-Tech non-stick coating that eliminates the use of oil or fat when cooking. The crisper tray uses Air-Crisp Technology that allows heated air to pass through and circulate 360° of your bacon without turning. While the drip pan catches the grease, it can also be used as a baking sheet. The pan with the rack measures 13\" x 11\". The crisper tray and drip can are both dishwasher-safe and oven-safe up to 450°F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DF376AKAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copper Chef","source_asin":"B07HHCK4VP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HHCK4VP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HHCK4VP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
