window.products.push({"id":593549,"name":"Vaeqozva Portable Blender, Personal Size Mini Blender, 17 Oz USB Rechargeable Jucier Cup, Shakes and Smoothies with Ice Tray for Home, Travel, Sport, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xQxZLJCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multi-Function With Ice Tray & Large Capacity】This Vaeqozva portable shake blender is great for making smoothies, protein shake, juice, mix fruits, vegetables, milk powder and baby supplementary food. The flexible silicone ice tray makes uniform, easy-to-remove ice cubes. To release cubes, simply hold silicone tray upside down and twist, gently pushing on each cube from the bottom of the tray. With 500ML large size bottle, you can enioy plenty of fresh and delicious smoothie throughout the day. 【Strong Power System & Fast Blending】The portable smoothie blender is equipped with strong motor, six sharper 304 stainless steel blades and a high speed of 18,000 rpm, which can chop and mix food more thoroughly and evenly, making it more delicate and delicious in 30 seconds. It's perfect for making protein shakes, smoothies, juices, etc. 【Waterproof Design & Easy to Clean】With waterproof design, you can rinse the entire exterior of the blender cup without worrying about water entering the interior and causing engine damage. To prolong the life of the handheld blender, please don’ t soak the base in water for a long time. For internal cleaning, simply fill some water and double click the button to start automatic cleaning. The matching brush will make it easier for you to clean the blades thoroughly. 【USB Rechargeable Battery & Portable】Built-in 4000mAh rechargeable lithium ion battery, the portable usb blender can produce 20 cups of juice after fully charged via USB cables for 3-5 hours. The wireless blender can be easily charged with a variety of power devices anywhere, convenient for you to keep it on the go, especially suitable for office, gym, outdoor, travel, camping or fishing. The power indicator intelligently shows the remaining power and reminds to charge when the battery is low. 【Safe Material & Safe To Use】The blender cup is made of food-grade material, BPA-Free, non-toxic, safe for making fresh nutritious delicacies for old people and children. On the go blender is designed with safe magnetic switch, it will only operate while the bottle and the base are tightened. Please make sure the red arrow aim to switch before blending.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xQxZLJCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vaeqozva","source_asin":"B09DCMLYFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DCMLYFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DCMLYFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
