window.products.push({"id":593576,"name":"Scratch Off World Map: Large Travel Wall Poster Maps with Country Flags and Landmarks - United States & Countries Outlined - 35 x 24 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xWmiPo3AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRACK YOUR TRAVELS For those of us consumed by wanderlust, travel is like second nature. With the Scratch Landmarks Map you’ll be able to document and display your travels like never before. Our comprehensive, 35 x 24 inch map features 59 famous scratch-off landmarks and 193 different country flags. In addition to countries, our geographically detailed map is outlined for the individual states of the U.S. and Australia, as well as the provinces of Canada. Free USA Map also included. STYLISH DESIGN Are you looking for a unique way to spruce up your space and some style? The Scratch Landmarks Map is perfect for adding some flair to your home, office, classroom or workspace. Unlike other world map posters, our map is made from an attractive, high contrast, durable paper that’s finished in beautiful black and gold foil. Our foil surface is made from a durable and eco-friendly resin that will stand up to the test of time. SCRATCH OFF When it comes to traveling, it can be hard to keep track of every country you’ve visited. Unlike other maps, the Scratch Landmarks Map is unique to each person. Our map allows you to scratch off the foil of the countries or landmarks you’ve visited to reveal brilliant colors and vivid details of the countries, mountains and much more. FREE ACCESSORIES Is there anything better than getting free stuff? With a Scratch Landmarks Map, you get more than just a map. We included one scratch pick for removing the foil, a magnifying strip, memory stickers, wiping cloth, a protective tube and an accessories storage bag. We also want to make sure you’re happy with your purchase. That’s why we offer a full, 100% refund within 30 days of purchase. GREAT GIFT Are you searching for a unique birthday present or a gift for the holidays? If so, give your loved ones the gift of travel. The Scratch Landmarks Map is the perfect gift for the travel enthusiast in your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xWmiPo3AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scratch Landmark Maps","source_asin":"B07BV3N7LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BV3N7LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BV3N7LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
