window.products.push({"id":593647,"name":"SOCIALCOMFY Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly, Heavy Duty Lift Chair with Heat and Massage, Faux Leather Recliner Chair with 2 Remote Controls, Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+YqkhEL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Power Lift Assistance】 - Counter-balanced lift mechanism with TUV certified motor pushes the entire chair up to assist the senior stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees, smoothly adjust to lift or reclining position you prefer by pressing the buttons on the remote control 【TUV Approved Motor】 - The lift motor of the chair have obtained TUV certification and have better performance, the more quiet operation, longer service lifespan. Our lift recliner chair reclines up to 150 degrees, the footrest and backrest are extended or retracted simultaneously. You can smoothly adjust to customized position and stop at any position you needed 【Massage & Lumbar Heat】 - Equipped with 4 powerful massage parts (back, lumbar, thighs, legs) and 5 massage modes for selection, each massage point can be operated individually. There is timer function in 15/30/60 minutes which is convenient for you to set massaging time. Add a lumbar heat point to promote blood circulation throughout your body, providing a full body relaxation! 【Humanized Design】 - This lift chair has dual USB outlets that keep your devices charging. (Notes: The USB port ONLY for low-power devices, such as iPhone, iPad). Two side pockets and two front pockets for small items within reach, two cup holders on both sides of armrests to hold your drinks for best meets your needs 【Easy to Assemble】 - Super easy to assemble and usually only need 10-15mins to finish the installation, no tools required. If any shipping damage when it arrive or defective during usage, please feel free to reach out to us, we will provide best solution in 24 hours. We also provide 1 year technical support for the lift motor and steel frame","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+YqkhEL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOCIALCOMFY","source_asin":"B0BHHSCSP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHHSCSP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHHSCSP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
