window.products.push({"id":593649,"name":"DOWAN Ramekins with Lids 6 oz Oven Safe, Creme brulee Souffle Ramekins with Covers, Porcelain White Ramekins for Baking, Stackable, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Nlhkb2qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ramekins with lids: With the lids on the ramekins, baked items can stay warm after being pulled out of the oven. The lids are a wonderful addition for leftovers. They seal well so they're great for storing food in the fridge and convenient to reheat the food. Also, they are perfect to pack in lunches or a breakfast on the go. Versatile Ramekins Bowls: With a capacity of 6 oz, these ramekins with lids are perfect for preparing and serving individual portions of a variety of dishes, including creme brulee, souffle, cake, quiches, baked eggs, chocolate mousse, and more. High-fired Porcelain Safe for Dishwasher, Microwave, Oven, and Freezer: Creme brulee ramekins constructed from durable porcelain, a type of premium lead-free, chip-resistant, and more sturdy than stainless steel. It can be used in the microwave or oven up to 500°F, and is safe for dishwasher and freezer (except the lid). Easy to Clean and Store: Interior and exterior glaze protect the ramekin set against stains, making them easy to clean. Souffle ramekins are stackable for easier storage. These ramekins with covers can perfectly stack and no more worry about breakage and glaze abrasion. Precautions for Use: How to cover the lid: Open the small hole before covering the lid. Cover the bowl with the lid, then press the lid gently and cover the small hole. How to open the lid: Open the small hole before removing the lid, then you can remove the lid easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Nlhkb2qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWAN","source_asin":"B0B9N94BPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9N94BPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9N94BPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
