window.products.push({"id":593716,"name":"Fenrici Tie Dye Lunch Box for Boys, Girls, Kids Insulated Lunch Bag for School, Soft Sided Compartments, Spacious, BPA Free, Food Safe,10.8in x 8.5in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815vTJLbJWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT SHELL TIE DYE LUNCH BOX: Unlike many hard-shell lunch boxes that are too bulky and get damaged easily, our soft-shell 10.8”W x 8.5”H x 2.8”D boy's lunch bag will fit every size and shape containers without skipping a beat! KID'S FRIENDLY BLUE TIE DYE LUNCH BOX: Our popular tie dye lunch box for boys and girls is made of tough woven 900-denier polyester for durability. Plenty of space for bulky items like thermos and drink boxes, with Interior ID tag for additional personalization. TIE DYE LUNCH BOX WITH MULTIPLE POCKETS: The Fenrici lunch box features 1x exterior pocket with hook and release for napkin and extra storage and 1x interior mesh pocket for cold pack, utensils, and snacks. FOOD SAFE AND EARTH-FRIENDLY LUNCH BOX: The BPA-free Interior lining is made of advanced, non-toxic PEVA, an environmentally friendly, food-safe vinyl that’s made without chlorine or plasticizers. It is PVC free, Phthalate free, and lead free. Impactful Purchase: Each purchase of a Fenrici lunch box supports research and education for childhood rare diseases through Global Genes. Join us in making a positive impact.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815vTJLbJWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fenrici","source_asin":"B08TMF594M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMF594M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMF594M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":593717,"name":"Messermeister Meridian Elite Steak Knife, 4.5-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZUkZ-dcbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Messermeister Meridian Elité knife collection defines tradition with a triple rivet, full-exposed tang handle. These knives are one-piece, hot-drop hammer forged from a single billet of the finest German stainless steel alloy and fitted with the most durable industrial strength, ergonomic handle in the world. Meridian Elité knives are handcrafted and polished one at a time using the same techniques that have been the hallmark of fine Solingen-made cutlery that have stood the test of time. Meridian Elité knives are the authentically superior, forged and triple-riveted knives manufactured in Solingen, Germany. Amazon.com This is Messermeister's top-of-the-line Elite steak knife. It is forged from a single piece of high-carbon stainless steel and distinguished from the company's first-rate San Moritz knife by a three-step hand sharpening process the blade undergoes and a classic three-rivet, full-tang, seamless polymer handle. The 9-inch table knife is specially designed to slice a thick steak, pork chop, or beef roast into bite-size pieces. Though its 4-1/2-inch blade is serrated on the upper half and tends to tear meat fibers rather than slice precisely through them the way straight-edge knives do, fine serrations reduce the tearing effect, and the blade's lower half is straight. Made in Germany, the knife comes in a padded gift box. To keep the blade sharp, it's best to hand wash this knife in soapy water. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZUkZ-dcbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Messermeister","source_asin":"B07SWV945Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SWV945Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SWV945Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
