window.products.push({"id":593849,"name":"KETIEE Travel Mug 12oz, Insulated Coffee Mug to Go, Coffee Tumbler, Reusable Coffee Cups with Spill Proof Lid, Vacuum Stainless Steel Travel Coffee Mu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EqbtR2jvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Hot and Cold for Hours】 KETIEE-insulated travel mug is Stainless Steel Double-Wall vacuum with no seam for maximum temperature resistance, prevents heat transfer to outer wall, keeps drinks hot for 4h/ cold for 6h. Pour hot or frozen coffee into your coffee travel mug and feel energized all the day. 【Screw-On Leakproof Lid】 One of the most important features of KETIEE 12oz coffee travel mug is to make sure it won't leak if it is knocked over or in a bag. Because a leak-proof screw cap is supplied that can be firmly attached. Together with a sealing ring, which means your drink is airtight to minimize the risk of spills. Drink hole on the top for easy sipping. Just bring your coffee cup to go! 【Double Walled Stainless Steel Coffee Tumbler】 The insulated coffee cup with BPA-free is made of high quality stainless steel, which is robust and durable, keeps the drink without any special smell. Non-slip rubber ring of the cup can help you hold the cup in one hand easily. The removable lid, smooth edge and the interior of the mug with the no seam features make it easy to clean. Hand wash only. 【Perfect Capacity】 380ml capacity of the travel mug with beautiful shape and the cup body is light, bring you a good feeling for using, you can enjoy your coffee, tea, wine, juice, oatmeal quite well. Suitable for indoor and outdoor use such as the car, home, parties, travel and office hours. 【Designed for Car Cup Holders】This coffee mugs fit most of vehicle cup holders, great for daily life and outdoor adventures, such as home, office, parties road trips, camping , traveling, in the car, at the beach, hiking, sporting active, picnics. 【Gifts and After-sales】 The stainless steel coffee mug has been carefully color-coordinated, a contrasting design that is fashionable and timeless. The insulated KETIEE travel mug is a great Valentine's Day, Thanks Giving Day, Black Friday gift for your family and friends. If you encounter any problems at the time of purchase or after receiving the package, please contact us in time. We are happy to solve your problems. 【 Warm Tips For KETIEE Travel Mug 】1.Don't overfill your insulated travel mug with hot food or drinks. It could spill and scald you. The capacity of your KETIEE reusable coffee cups is designed to be filled just below the lid. 2.To prevent spills, make sure your lid and stopper are screwed on completely before use. 3. Keep away from fire. Hand wash only. Do not microwave. No heat. 【 For Best Results of Your Stainless Steel Vacuum Coffee Mugs 】1. Preheat or precool your coffee travel mug by filling it with hot or cold water. 2. Let stand for 5 minutes. 3. Empty your coffee cup and immediately fill with your favorite hot or cold drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EqbtR2jvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KETIEE","source_asin":"B09GXP9HSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXP9HSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXP9HSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
