window.products.push({"id":593970,"name":"HOME-X Tempered Glass Cutting Board-Chopping Board-Non-Slip, Shatter-Resistant, Durable, Stain-Resistant, and Dishwasher Safe-LARGE 11\" x 15\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R8zgE8wKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cutting boards are supposed to keep your countertops clean and free from damage, which is why you’ll need one that you can depend on. Fortunately, we have a solution for you. Our rectangle cutting board offers superior protection while providing sufficient space to cut up your food. You can use it for dicing vegetables, slicing fruit, filleting fish, and chopping meat. It’s also useful for cutting bread. This cutting board is made from good sturdy glass. Because it’s made from glass, it is dishwasher-friendly. The glass will handle the high heats and pressure of a dishwasher with ease. The material won’t warp, bend, crack, or shatter in the hot water. Instead, it will maintain its rectangular shape. Food will wipe right off, making cleaning up easy once you’ve finished preparing a meal. Its glass construction also ensures that it is nonporous. With this cutting tray, you can rest assured that your food will be kept clean and safe. This chopping board can withstand cuts from even the sharpest and heaviest of knives. The bottom of the cutting board has 4 non-slip grips to hold it in place while you cut your food. You won’t have to worry about the board slipping and sliding while you work. This modern cutting board makes a great gift for new neighbors, birthdays, or weddings. Men and women alike will appreciate the utility of a cutting board since cooking is part of daily life. Order a cutting board for your friends, family members, or yourself! You will love the durability and protection this high-quality cutting board gives you. Add it to your kitchen gadgets and supplies today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R8zgE8wKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07SPFN27M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-593970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SPFN27M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SPFN27M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
